Puro torture lang ito.

694
00:41:50.049 --> 00:41:52.134
Bakit kailangan ko siyang halikan?

695
00:41:56.305 --> 00:41:58.098
Siguro isang maikling idlip lang.

696
00:42:14.949 --> 00:42:16.033
TEAM MEMBER GO DA-RIM

697
00:42:16.116 --> 00:42:19.036
KUMPLETO ANG 22ND CYCLE SA 0100 HOURS,
MR. GONG!

698
00:42:23.624 --> 00:42:25.334
I bet nakatulog na siya ngayon.

699
00:42:25.918 --> 00:42:27.002
Sige na Da-rim.

700
00:42:28.128 --> 00:42:30.381
Sinibak ka dahil sa pagpapabaya sa tungkulin.

701
00:42:57.199 --> 00:42:58.784
Go Da-rim!

702
00:42:59.410 --> 00:43:00.452
